#: zchat/templates/index.html:243
msgid "职路由一群热爱职业发展领域的专业人士创立，用AI与大数据为每个选择注入科学的力量，让职业成长告别盲目试错。"
msgstr ""
"VoyLead was founded by a group of professionals passionate about career "
"development, using AI and big data to inject scientific power into every "
"choice, making career growth free from blind trial and error."

#: zchat/templates/index.html:244
msgid "我们的团队汇集了AI算法专家、资深职业规划师、顶尖猎头合伙人及前大厂HRBP，共同打造这款专注于职业发展的应用。"
msgstr ""
"Our team brings together AI algorithm experts, senior career planners, "
"top headhunting partners, and former HRBPs from major companies to create"
" this career development-focused application."

#: zchat/templates/index.html:245
msgid "我们的使命是赋能每一位职场人士，让职业发展变得更加清晰、高效和充满可能性。真正做到有路可依，有\"职路\"，不走弯路。"
msgstr ""
"Our mission is to empower every professional, making career development "
"clearer, more efficient, and full of possibilities. Truly providing a "
"clear path, a 'VoyLead', without detours."

